msgstr "길을 잘못 들었어요!"

msgid "Adaptive Cruise Control Only"
msgstr "어댑티브 크루즈 컨트롤만"

msgid "Initializing GLFW..."
msgstr "GLFW 초기화 중..."

msgid "3D Renderer"
msgstr "3D 렌더러"

